<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2<B>2016</B></FONT></SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>14</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">鲁煜恺</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">上海财经大学</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">此次获得绍兴一中英贤奖学金，激动之情溢于言表。获此殊荣，首先要感谢母校绍兴一中给予了我这一荣誉，也要感谢鲁家贤先生的关怀与厚爱。这不仅是我高中生涯最好的留念，更是未来前进途中的鞭策动力。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">正是母校博雅通达的理念和求真务实的氛围才使我得以行稳致远。同时，我也要借此机会感谢在高中时期陪伴我们共同奋斗的老师们和父母。我所获得的成绩离不开他们的无私奉献和鼎力相助。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">还有一路走来的同窗们，我们一起亮剑高考的场景至今历历在目，大家的相互鼓励和竞争是促使我不断前进的精神动力。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">风雪多经人不老，关山初度路犹长。在今后的学习生活中，我会戒骄戒躁，再接再厉，厚积薄发，再创辉煌，时刻牢记母校教给我的学习精神和人生道理，争取实现“今天我以母校为荣，明天母校必将以我为傲”的誓言！</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
